      ],
      "source": "https://www.chsmls.com/post/ravenel-south-carolina-a-historic-railroad-town"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ravenel served as a vital whistle stop and watering place for steam locomotives traveling between Charleston and Savannah.",
